{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "1df9c497d3b0ac0229c4167be72598fc9e0a2c28d85fa3bb029d6f72b851ef75", "ja": "書き出しはどうしようかな～？\nあっ、ラジオネームも決めないと！", "zh": "开头要怎么写好呢～？\n啊，还得想个电台昵称才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b436cb66a14a77df27432680d6ee2568375313e5964811114955d115fd3729cb", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。\nフツオタって聞こえましたけど、なんでしたっけ？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。\n我好像听到了“普通来信”，那是什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "5a8ab4de3175f4536303cf7c9589f24fd40e9c2a0f652e328968d5166b98e6f0", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "0a58ee26b528e9d542b12024cbd606d56315052b0bcdd8528c478769ae111811", "ja": "フツオタっていうのは、ラジオの普通のお便りコーナー\nのことですよ♪　ラジオ、あんまり聞きませんか？", "zh": "所谓“普通来信”，就是广播里的普通听众来信环节哦♪您平时不太听广播吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b9535fcf8ba9c083e93a678672dcaee8b8d0fbd15f14bbe2650229a715c5f8f5", "ja": "あ、そうでした。ラジオはもちろん仕事で聞くんですが\n個人的には、最近忙しくてあまり……。", "zh": "啊，对了。广播我当然会因为工作去听，不过私下最近比较忙，所以不太……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "54f4abe3e2393ee7e9f02d2cc496f467950795edaaf7f5ba515d73abda26a593", "ja": "青羽さんはラジオ、よく聞くんですか。", "zh": "青羽小姐平时经常听广播吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "76b38e433da34b297096e74d491088a9b702c11f712b5ab4f639a959ef37f216", "ja": "はい♪　作業しながら流すのにちょうどよくて。\n毎週聞いてる番組もあるんですよ♪", "zh": "是的♪ 放着当工作时的背景音刚刚好。\n也有我每周都会听的节目哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "e52d0548eeb95539f1e2ac04f3472377585296423c51f20f9d8bc091ea8d2721", "ja": "今、その番組のフツオタコーナーに\nお便りを送っちゃおうかなーって考えてました！", "zh": "刚才我还在想，要不要给那个节目的普通听众来信环节投稿呢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6f185b0c7215bc266501849e1e280545c3c6f748fecb7cc2bcd8e8b1c2a04d94", "ja": "なるほど、いいですね。お便りを読んでもらえたら、\nラジオを聞く楽しみも増えますし。", "zh": "原来如此，挺不错的。如果能让节目读到来信，听广播也会更有乐趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "939d7e5fe5d8f97d95fe9079313e0b3918f569301ef71bd31eed4de30576d213", "ja": "ドキドキですよね～♪　あ、ドキドキといえば、\nさっき社長さんから連絡がありましたよ！", "zh": "会让人心跳加速呢～♪　啊，说到心跳加速，刚才社长联系我了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "123f788523822bf8e62efa001b9e79556a084f1c9b6fa275ce5b787d689571c6", "ja": "そうでしたか。何だろう、いつものことですけど\nドキドキしますね……。ちょっと行ってきます！", "zh": "原来如此。会是什么事呢，虽然平时也是这样，\n还是让人有点忐忑不安……我先过去一趟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "c6695bc5ce70611167354f0b81bd747d726c79acc9feff65abc8d706ee097d12", "ja": "はーい♪　ドキドキ頑張ってくださいね～♪", "zh": "好呀♪要加油保持心跳加速哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1012_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "cf663b69d3dc2594679b1266473536788f5cc7ae093a682b2a8cfb49968b90d3", "ja": "おお君、よく来てくれたね！\nいやぁ、いい話があるんだよ！", "zh": "哦，你来得正好！\n哎呀，有个好消息要告诉你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9bb2d204801c22ba93afd8c244d5b105d6501561f548736c8600752f3554f822", "ja": "お疲れさまです、社長。\nいい話ですか？　ますますドキドキしますね！", "zh": "辛苦了，社长。\n好消息吗？这下更让人期待了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "f02525c16c4fa6fbb957660edb5ccbf1ab154d0f4c01cba1701eb2114094e329", "ja": "うむ。実はラジオ局の知り合いから連絡があってね。\nラジオの番組枠を、ひとつ増やせそうなんだ。", "zh": "嗯。其实广播电台那边的熟人联系我了。\n好像可以再增加一个广播节目时段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "119dbd9dbce03aad6ee2ad337f454852cd08883b4dffb1ff699700f61c5413b0", "ja": "そこで、この機会に劇場のアイドル諸君に、\nレギュラー番組を持ってもらうのはどうかと思ってね。", "zh": "所以我想，不如趁这个机会，让剧场的偶像们拥有一档固定节目吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e38e0486d18641e9ed350d963580e4511925843d5a5afea659bad9fe4985fe47", "ja": "ラジオのレギュラー番組ですか。なるほど……。\nたしかに、そういうのは今ありませんね。", "zh": "是广播节目的固定栏目吗？原来如此……\n确实，目前还没有这样的节目呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "7c53a735012c3e000a7f2443e789da10cdf1d0dc6943be419a154245e1062ac5", "ja": "ラジオは気軽にアイドルの素顔に触れてもらえますし、\nレギュラーなら、継続的な交流の場にもできそうです。", "zh": "广播能让大家轻松接触到偶像真实的一面，\n如果是固定节目，似乎也能成为持续交流的平台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "6e41e3749f442cdc3a6a40d5ad50877beb31125ea81607363b5521955f4783f4", "ja": "その通り、さすが君だ。\n是非この機会を活かしてくれたまえ！", "zh": "正是如此，不愧是你。\n务必好好把握这次机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "437ecc5c2af50b0ae2807fe6ffb11665e43195429ea19a7de66f30f0412084da", "ja": "メインパーソナリティの選出も君に任せよう。\nパッと思いつく候補はいるかね？", "zh": "主主持人的人选也交给你来决定。\n你有没有马上想到合适的人选？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6d7e2fe41648c2de4c7be8f1a99cadf0fbb10b930db028c426fe817d1e9b50da", "ja": "そうですね。ぼんやりとですが……\n調整できると思います。", "zh": "是啊。虽然还只是有个大概的想法……\n我觉得可以协调一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "49df424646cb11f7580a0e755db1032d724b1fe031eb3f8d154153957c27ede8", "ja": "うむ！　アイドル諸君がどんなラジオを作り上げて\nいってくれるのか、楽しみにしているよ！", "zh": "嗯！我很期待偶像诸君会为我们\n打造出怎样的广播节目哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "9d0b8af193af4137c260e86fced3c5bafa9a6e9ca99c410066ee495cc57c55d8", "ja": "わかりました。\nところで、今日は音無さんの姿が見えませんね？", "zh": "明白了。\n对了，今天好像没看到音无小姐呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "647a5bcda7e6202a6a1b06b8f75164a8cca51335d4289cfb7f087a05617d8a25", "ja": "ああ、ちょっと席を外すと言っていたかな。\n集中してやりたいことがあるそうなんだが……。", "zh": "啊，好像说过要暂时离开一下。\n听说是有想集中精力去做的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "b34afbf648648ae91cf9f46ebc8018093d1dba90867276d18ed1996f9f8ac744", "ja": "詳しいことは教えてくれなくてねぇ……。あ、\nそうそう、あとで君に連絡するとも言っていたかな？", "zh": "他没有告诉我详情……。啊，对了，好像还说了之后会联系你？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "2aad604347119b02abbb4bf75784d9c826fcced480cc446e35505e7aedf885d0", "ja": "そうでしたか。なんだろうな……。\nとりあえず連絡を待ってみますね。", "zh": "这样啊。到底会是什么呢……  \n总之，我先等联系吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "ce5b2ad2ab2e993816f3870bbdfc748cb225b839cf970a78030706e871bc2e3e", "ja": "（さて、まずはラジオのパーソナリティを決めないと。\nレギュラー番組だし、相性や多様性を考えて……）", "zh": "（那么，首先得决定电台节目的主持人。\n既然是固定节目，就从契合度和多样性方面考虑……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "ba16e6c27514d1307528c4cadf0140c9b5a28e0320e3dd2d1ffaddf4722ea19c", "ja": "（うん、やっぱりあの3人で行こう！）", "zh": "（嗯，果然还是选那3个人吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
